    "detailed_description": "<i>Enter ATLYSS,</i> a strange world thriving with creatures and critters. With the outside realm and dungeons deep ahead, there will be plenty of locations to explore and discover.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >- Three primary classes to choose -</h2>Start off as a witty novice, destined to choose between three primary classes:<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Fighter </strong>- The melee warrior class that deals devastating damage and threat.<br></li><li><strong>Mystic </strong>- The caster class that evokes arcane magic to their advantage.<br></li><li><strong>Bandit </strong>- The acrobatic mercenary class, experts of ranged weapons and quick melee weaponry.</li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >- Play alone, or with Friends -</h2>ATLYSS is made around net-play, but can also be played offline as well with no opportunities or features lost.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >- Character Customization -</h2>Make your character with five races to choose from, with color, head, and body sliders.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >- Your character, saved locally -</h2>All of your character progression data is saved locally and easily accessed within the game's data directory. Play a character in single-player, and join in later to a net-play session where you left off, and vice versa.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >- Questing Abound -</h2>Party up with friends and take on quests to kill creatures, discover new locations, and help the last remaining safe haven of the world.",
